## Apache Maven Wrapper

`crates/ciac-backend-java/vendor/mvnw` and `mvnw.cmd` vendor the Apache
Maven Wrapper (https://github.com/apache/maven-wrapper), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The upstream project's own NOTICE file
